# Keep secrets, VCS metadata, runtime state and dependency trees out of the
# build context (and therefore out of the builder stage's `COPY . .`).
#
# NOT excluded on purpose: /squilla, admin-ui/dist, extensions/*/bin and
# extensions/*/admin-ui/dist — Dockerfile.local copies those prebuilt
# artifacts from the host.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
storage
data
**/node_modules
.claude
.agents
.superpowers
.planning
tmp
*.test
*.out
